@startuml
title Whale Simulation

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

participant "SimOrchestratorNode" as Orchestrator
participant "WhaleNode" as Whale

Orchestrator -> Whale : Request next whale call
Whale -> Whale : Find earliest remaining call
Whale --> Orchestrator : Next call or no future call

Orchestrator ->> Whale : SimStep
Whale -> Whale : Update whale positions
Whale -> Whale : Publish ground truth and log trajectory samples

Orchestrator ->> Whale : Shutdown

@enduml
